  "summary_insights": [
    "Revenue is forecast to grow by 1.9% in FY26, with a significant acceleration projected for FY27 (+10.1%) and FY28 (+11.1%).",
    "Gross margin is expected to compress from 37.8% to 35.2% in FY26, driven by a 6.3% increase in Cost of Sales that outpaces revenue growth.",
    "Operating profit (EBITDA) is forecast to drop by 38.3% in FY26 due to a 17.5% rise in administrative expenses, including £200k investment in AI systems.",
    "Net profit is projected to decline by 40.3% in FY26, though management attributes this to temporary timing effects from UK Building Safety Act regulatory delays.",
    "The company maintains a very strong interest coverage ratio, which improves significantly in FY26 as interest-bearing liabilities appear to be reduced.",
    "Staff costs are a major overhead, representing 21.1% of turnover in FY26, which management notes is in line with industrial manufacturer benchmarks.",
    "A new D2C division, Lurano, was launched in FY26, contributing an initial £159k to the top line with further growth expected.",
    "Profitability is forecast to recover strongly post-FY26, with EBITDA margins projected to return to 15.4% by FY28."
  ],
